<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, today I give unto Thee,</l><l>Saturate me, capture me,</l><l>Shine upon me, burn within me,</l><l>Purge my darkness, sin in me.</l><l>Free from every fetter, burden,</l><l>Joy in choosing all Your ways,</l><l>Keeping to the path You’ve trodden,</l><l>I’ll submit to You always.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
